e [[Sophie Casterwill]]. This Suit, however, was defeated by Sophie and [[Santiago]].  {{Source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\nShe was one of the many Suits called in by DeFoe to stop Dante Vale, Lok Lambert, and Sophie Casterwill in the Venice Huntik Library. This Suit, along with the others, was defeated by Dante's team and Santiago. {{source|The Casterwill Client}}","text":"She was sent by DeFoe to assist in the retrieval of Eathon Lambert's journal. Along with another Suit and their Mindrone Titans, she attempted to capture Sophie Casterwill. This Suit, however, was defeated by Sophie and Santiago. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nShe was one of the many Suits called in by DeFoe to stop Dante Vale, Lok Lambert, and Sophie Casterwill in the Venice Huntik Library. This Suit, along with the others, was defeated by Dante's team and Santiago. [The Casterwill Client]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"Like most Suits, she was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]] and spells.\n\n{{Col-begin}}\n{{Col-2}}","text":"Like most Suits, she was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells."},{"heading":"Spells Utilized","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Augerfrost]]\n* [[Hyperstride]]\n* [[Raypulse]]\n\n{{Col-2}}","text":"• Augerfrost\n• Hyperstride\n• Raypulse"},{"heading":"Bonded Titans","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Bonelasher]]\n* [[Enforcer]]\n* [[Kreutalk]] ([[TCG:SAS-111|TCG]])\n* [[Mindrone]]\n\n{{Col-end}}","text":"• Bonelasher\n• Enforcer\n• Kreutalk (TCG)\n• Mindrone"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\">\nFile:Unnamed Suit 004.png|Suit 004\nS1E14 Koskin Hubbs Suits.png|Suit 004 with [[Mr. Koskin]] and [[Charlene Hubbs]]\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"Image caption: Suit 004\n\nImage caption: Suit 004 with Mr. Koskin and Charlene Hubbs"}],"full_text":"Unnamed Suit 004 is a Suit working for the Organization, previously commanded by DeFoe. She is one of the agents stationed in Venice, Italy.\n\nHistory\n\nShe was sent by DeFoe to assist in the retrieval of Eathon Lambert's journal. Along with another Suit and their Mindrone Titans, she attempted to capture Sophie Casterwill. This Suit, however, was defeated by Sophie and Santiago. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nShe was one of the many Suits called in by DeFoe to stop Dante Vale, Lok Lambert, and Sophie Casterwill in the Venice Huntik Library. This Suit, along with the others, was defeated by Dante's team and Santiago. [The Casterwill Client]\n\nAbilities\n\nLike most Suits, she was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells.\n\nSpells Utilized\n\n• Augerfrost\n• Hyperstride\n• Raypulse\n\nBonded Titans\n\n• Bonelasher\n• Enforcer\n• Kreutalk (TCG)\n• Mindrone\n\nGallery\n\nImage caption: Suit 004\n\nImage caption: Suit 004 with Mr. Koskin and Charlene Hubbs","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox character\n| image  = File:Suit 7.jpg\n| group  = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br>[[Suits]]\n| base   = [[Venice, Italy]]<br>[[Prague, Czech Republic]]\n| gender = Female\n| hair   = Blonde\n| eyes   =\n| first  = \"[[A Seeker Is Born]]\"\n}}\n'''Unnamed Suit 004''' is a [[Suit]] working for [[the Organization]], previously commanded by [[DeFoe]]. She is one of the agents stationed in [[Venice, Italy]].\n\n== History ==\nShe was sent by [[DeFoe]] to assist in the retrieval of [[Eathon Lambert's journal]]. Along with [[Unnamed Suit 003|another Suit]] and their [[Mindrone]] Titans, she attempted to capture [[Sophie Casterwill]]. This Suit, however, was defeated by Sophie and [[Santiago]].  {{Source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\nShe was one of the many Suits called in by DeFoe to stop Dante Vale, Lok Lambert, and Sophie Casterwill in the Venice Huntik Library. This Suit, along with the others, was defeated by Dante's team and Santiago. {{source|The Casterwill Client}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, she was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]] and spells.\n\n{{Col-begin}}\n{{Col-2}}\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n* [[Augerfrost]]\n* [[Hyperstride]]\n* [[Raypulse]]\n\n{{Col-2}}\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n* [[Bonelasher]]\n* [[Enforcer]]\n* [[Kreutalk]] ([[TCG:SAS-111|TCG]])\n* [[Mindrone]]\n\n{{Col-end}}\n\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\">\nFile:Unnamed Suit 004.png|Suit 004\nS1E14 Koskin Hubbs Suits.png|Suit 004 with [[Mr. Koskin]] and [[Charlene Hubbs]]\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:8056","status":"resolved","target_title":"Venice, Italy","label":"Venice, Italy","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Venice%2C_Italy","href":"#/categories?name=Venice%2C%20Italy"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:8072","status":"resolved","target_title":"Prague, Czech Republic","label":"Prague, Czech Republic","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Prague%2C_Czech_Republic","href":"#/categories?name=Prague%2C%20Czech%20Republic"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2257","status":"resolved","target_title":"A Seeker Is Born","label":"A Seeker Is Born","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/A_Seeker_Is_Born","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2257"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suit","label":"Suit","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suit","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization"